0_245504311315137_1481932687454205859_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=4BUz27MVm8QQ7kNvwFOPATX&_nc_oc=AdqagJfIB8swL2-0SDGuK0xmM82Ej6r4Wbs80YN6WvqqIjIGyF-vPiH0INk2vSxDfic&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af9lQNSZSMu35dZgeyTPyp54YO1Id83xexfn41sd_DkLVg&oe=6A36A4D0"}, "display_name": "Reaction of Barium Chloride with Sodium Sulphate", "keywords": [], "long_description": "XR Guru's VR Chemistry Lab offers an exceptional and immersive learning experience for exploring the reaction of barium chloride with sodium sulfate. Inside this virtual laboratory, users are empowered to actively participate in experiments, explore the distinctive properties of the substances involved, and witness the captivating reactions that unfold within a secure and interactive environment.\n\nAn expert virtual lab assistant can guide you through the experiment process, providing outstanding support and expertise. Moreover, users can conduct independent experiments, further reinforcing their understanding without external assistance.\n\nThis remarkable platform revolutionizes the learning process by simulating these experiments in an immersive and interactive manner, ensuring a comprehensive grasp of the barium chloride and sodium sulfate reaction while enhancing knowledge retention for the long term.", "short_description": "XR Guru's VR Chemistry Lab offers an exceptional and immersive learning experience for exploring the reaction of barium chloride with sodium sulfate. Inside this virtual laboratory, users are empowered to actively participate in experiments, explore the distinctive properties of the substances involved, and witness the captivating reactions that unfold within a secure and interactive environment."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.holopundits.com/privacy-policy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Holo Pundits", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https